From 0e2213c1d8003f704092995c37e8dd9943141ea4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Markus Niebel <Markus.Niebel@ew.tq-group.com>
Date: Fri, 31 May 2024 16:37:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/26] tq: add TQMa8MPxL SoM and starter kit

Add board code including the different RAM configuration data
for TQ-Systems GmbH solderable SoM based on i.MX8MP SoC family.
The SoM needs a base board.

The code is intended to be usable for different base boards.
With this commit the Starter Kit / SBC MBa8MPxL is also added.

Signed-off-by: Markus Niebel <Markus.Niebel@ew.tq-group.com>
Co-authored-by: Stein Alexander <alexander.stein@tq-group.com>
